cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GeomWhisper
message: If you use GeomWhisper in research, please cite the software using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tushar
    family-names: Patni
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  GeomWhisper is a locally runnable Shiny application for conversational and
  voice-driven refinement of ggplot visualizations using multiple large
  language model providers.
keywords:
  - R
  - Shiny
  - ggplot2
  - data visualization
  - large language models
  - voice interface